-2 rounded-full bg-orange-50 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-bold text-orange-700\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-sparkles\"><path d=\"M9.937 15.5A2 2 0 0 0 8.5 14.063l-6.135-1.582a.5.5 0 0 1 0-.962L8.5 9.936A2 2 0 0 0 9.937 8.5l1.582-6.135a.5.5 0 0 1 .963 0L14.063 8.5A2 2 0 0 0 15.5 9.937l6.135 1.581a.5.5 0 0 1 0 .964L15.5 14.063a2 2 0 0 0-1.437 1.437l-1.582 6.135a.5.5 0 0 1-.963 0z\"></path><path d=\"M20 3v4\"></path><path d=\"M22 5h-4\"></path><path d=\"M4 17v2\"></path><path d=\"M5 18H3\"></path></svg>Vehicle service, simplified</div><h1 class=\"text-6xl font-black leading-[.98] tracking-[-0.05em]\">Your vehicle.<br/><span class=\"text-orange-500\">Serviced smarter.</span></h1><p class=\"mt-6 max-w-xl text-lg leading-8 text-slate-600\">Sign in to book, track and manage your vehicle service.</p><ul class=\"mt-8 max-w-md space-y-3\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3 text-slate-700\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-emerald-500\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg>Book service at garages near you</li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3 text-slate-700\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-emerald-500\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg>Track your vehicle live, from pickup to delivery</li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3 text-slate-700\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-emerald-500\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg>Pay and download invoices in one place</li></ul><div class=\"mt-10 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-slate-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map-pin text-orange-500\"><path d=\"M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg>Workshops near you, just a tap away</div></section><section class=\"fade-up-2\"><div class=\"card mx-auto max-w-md p-7 sm:p-9\"><div class=\"mb-8 flex items-center gap-3\"><div class=\"grid size-12 place-items-center rounded-2xl bg-slate-950 text-orange-400\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-car\"><path d=\"M19 17h2c.6 0 1-.4 1-1v-3c0-.9-.7-1.7-1.5-1.9C18.7 10.6 16 10 16 10s-1.3-1.4-2.2-2.3c-.5-.4-1.1-.7-1.8-.7H5c-.6 0-1.1.4-1.4.9l-1.4 2.9A3.7 3.7 0 0 0 2 12v4c0 .6.4 1 1 1h2\"></path><circle cx=\"7\" cy=\"17\" r=\"2\"></circle><path d=\"M9 17h6\"></path><circle cx=\"17\" cy=\"17\" r=\"2\"></circle></svg></div><div><p class=\"font-black\">AutoServe</p><p class=\"text-xs text-slate-400\">Service OS</p></div></div><h2 class=\"text-3xl font-black\">Welcome back</h2><p class=\"muted mt-1\">Sign in with your mobile number or email.</p><form class=\"mt-7 space-y-4\" noValidate=\"\"><label class=\"block space-y-2\"><span class=\